        [
          740
        ],
        {
          "text": 741,
          "type": 80
        },
        "Connect with other creatives",
        {
          "type": 728,
          "content": 743
        },
        [
          744
        ],
        {
          "type": 76,
          "attrs": 745,
          "content": 746
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 139
        },
        [
          747
        ],
        {
          "text": 748,
          "type": 80
        },
        "Get opportunities and call-outs direct to your inbox",
        {
          "type": 76,
          "attrs": 750,
          "content": 751
        },
        {
          "textAlign": 139
        },
        [
          752
        ],
        {
          "text": 753,
          "type": 80,
          "marks": 754
        },
        "We already have hundreds of locals in the network – it’s a great opportunity to connect, share ideas, present your work, collaborate and more. As a member, you could find inspiration in the stories and journeys of others just like you. Whether you're a seasoned pro or a new to the scene, there's a spot for you.",
        [
          755
        ],
        {
          "type": 110,
          "attrs": 756
        },
        {
          "color": 17
        },
        {
          "type": 76,
