        },
        [
          760
        ],
        {
          "text": 761,
          "type": 80,
          "marks": 762
        },
        "You’ll hear about opportunities for exhibition space, training, project collaboration, artist call outs and more. Join us and discover the power of collaboration, the thrill of sharing ideas, and the joy of seeing your vision come to life.",
